  "plan": "Let me check if Docker is installed in different paths, and also start setting up the project directory.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "find / -name 'docker' -type f 2>/dev/null | head -5\n",
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "mkdir -p /home/user/project\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la /home/user/project/\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "Docker is not available in this environment. The project directory is now created. Since Docker is not available, I won't be able to actually create Docker containers, but I can still create the Docker work pool (which is just a configuration) and the deployment. Let me start the Prefect server first, then proceed with creating the work pool and flow.",
  "plan": "1. Start the Prefect server in the background\n2. Create the flow.py file with the hello_docker_flow function\n3. Create the Docker work pool named 'my-docker-pool'\n4. Create the deployment using 'prefect deploy' command with the specified image",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat > /home/user/project/flow.py << 'EOF'\nfrom prefect import flow\n\n\n@flow\ndef hello_docker_flow():\n    print(\"Hello from a Docker container!\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    hello_docker_flow()\nEOF\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat /home/user/project/flow.py\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cd /home/user/project && nohup prefect server start > /tmp/prefect-server.log 2>&1 &\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo \"Server PID: $!\"\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The flow.py file is created and the Prefect server is starting in the background (PID 1873). I need to wait for the server to be fully up before creating the work pool and deployment.",
  "plan": "Wait for the Prefect server to start, then check if it's ready by looking at the log and checking the API.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "",
      "duration": 10.0
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "tail -50 /tmp/prefect-server.log\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

